[N 30-31 Hillsbrad and Silverpine]
[D Forever Alliance 1-30 (Braedyn)\\Southshore in the Hillsbrad Foothills: the Down the Coast chain, the Hoard and Brewer deliveries and the turtle bisque, optional yeti, Syndicate and Crushridge extras, then the shaman's walk into Silverpine for the Water Totem and the flights to Ironforge.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel 30|r  -  you step off the Menethil boat at Southshore with the Excavation Site behind you; hearth = Sentinel Hill and it stays there (nothing here needs it). Southshore is the best quest hub of the 30s and every core mob is a plain non-elite: ~14,000 quest XP on the core loops, up to ~23,000 with the optional extras, and the shaman's Call of Water adds ~2,900 (about 1,800 after level decay). The Murloc Heads and the Turtle Meat have no drop rate in the DB, so each carries a budget below. You ding 31 around Gnomeregan (chapter 24).
[OC]|cffffcc00Log space:|r the log holds 25. The core adds 4 quests (536, 98071, 555, 98059) plus Farren's chain one link at a time; every extra below adds one more and is optional, so skip extras from the bottom of the list if the game says full. Reassignment (563) and, if you take it, Return to Milton (542) are handed in at Stormwind in chapter 25.
[OC]|cffffcc00Skipped on purpose:|r Talk of the Town (98463, Barkeep Kelly: 265 XP, an errand to Booty Bay), A Lack of Virtue (98459, Tom Half-fish: 165 XP, to Menethil, which the route does not revisit) and Foreboding Plans / Noble Deaths (510, 512: the Syndicate mobs for the rings are level 35-39).
[OC]|cffffcc00Training:|r nothing in Southshore trains you; the level-30 spells wait for Ironforge (chapter 24).

[OC]|cffffffffSouthshore|r  -  the flight path is already known (chapter 08), so there is nothing to do on the dock. Every giver stands within 8 units of the flight master (49.3,52.3); Captain McManus is 4 units north-west of it
At [TAR2228 Lieutenant Farren Orinelle], [QT98219] [QA536 Down the Coast] (1,850 XP, requires level 25: 10 Torn Fin Tidehunters and 10 Torn Fin Oracles on the Western Strand, |cff66ff66normal|r. If you never got The Shamed Lieutenant in Stormwind, just accept Down the Coast) [G51.5,58.4 Hillsbrad Foothills]
At [TAR2705 Brewmeister Bilger], [QA98071 Brewer's Trade] (2,200 XP, requires level 23: he hands you a Case of Fallrook Varietal to carry to Dun Garok in the south-east and asks for a sack of Homebrew Hops back - a pure delivery, |cff66ff66normal|r) [G52.1,58.7 Hillsbrad Foothills]
At [TAR2430 Chef Jessen], [QA555 Soothing Turtle Bisque] (2,500 XP, requires level 28: 10 Turtle Meat from the Snapjaws along the river east of town plus some Soothing Spices - |cffffcc00grind warning:|r the DB gives no drop rate and only 16 Snapjaws stand in the zone, 7 of them close to town; budget ~10 minutes, then give it up) [G51.9,58.7 Hillsbrad Foothills]
At [TAR2381 Micha Yance], buy 2 Soothing Spices for the bisque (the DB gives no count; she also sells Fine Thread) [G48.9,55.0 Hillsbrad Foothills]
[O][A Hunter] At [TAR3541 Sarah Raycroft] next to her, restock ammo (Razor Arrow or Solid Shot, 400+) for the coast loops and Gnomeregan [G49.1,55.1 Hillsbrad Foothills]

[OC]|cffffffffThe Hoard errand|r  -  a ~4-minute round trip: the town hall stands in the Hillsbrad Fields 19 units north-west of McManus. The shaman walks the same road again later
At [TAR251493 Captain McManus] north-west of the flight master, [QA98059 Hillsbrad's Hoard] (2,200 XP, requires level 23: he gives you a Sealed Company Request to leave on the bookkeeping table in the town hall - a pure delivery, |cff66ff66normal|r) [G46.5,50.1 Hillsbrad Foothills]
Walk to the town hall in the Hillsbrad Fields and put the Sealed Company Request on the bookkeeping table inside (the DB has no object for the table: the Hillsbrad Councilmen stand at 29.6,39.7 and Magistrate Burnside at 29.7,41.6, |cffffcc00unverified|r) [QC98059] [G29.6,41.5 Hillsbrad Foothills]
At [TAR251493 Captain McManus], [QT98059] [G46.5,50.1 Hillsbrad Foothills]

[OC]|cffffffffThe Western Strand|r  -  Farren's chain on the murloc coast south-west of town. Torn Fin Tidehunters (level 31-32) and Oracles (30-31) stand along the strand (x36-49, y63-73), ~20 of each, with Muckdwellers and Coastrunners (28-30, ~50 more) further west. They come in packs of 3-4: pull one pack at a time
Kill [TAR2377 Torn Fin Tidehunter] and [TAR2376 Torn Fin Oracle] (10 of each) on the strand south-west of town [QC536] [G42.6,68.6 Hillsbrad Foothills]
