Back on the strand kill any Torn Fin murloc until you hold 10 Murloc Heads [TAR2377 Torn Fin Tidehunter] [QC559] [G42.6,68.6 Hillsbrad Foothills]
At [TAR2228 Lieutenant Farren Orinelle], [QT559] [QA560 Farren's Proof] (the Sack of Murloc Heads goes to Marshal Redpath, 255 XP) [G51.5,58.4 Hillsbrad Foothills]
