[OC]|cffffffffEast coast and Dun Garok|r  -  Daggerspine naga on the south-east shore (Shorehunters level 30-31 x52-61 y63-78, Sirens 31-32 x53-62 y61-82; 17 and 19 spawns), then the dwarf fort at Dun Garok, which the DB places around 70,78. One loop, both south-east of town
Kill [TAR2369 Daggerspine Shorehunter] and [TAR2371 Daggerspine Siren] (10 of each) along the south-east shore [QC562] [G56.5,69.8 Hillsbrad Foothills]
