At [TAR2228 Lieutenant Farren Orinelle], [QT562] [QA563 Reassignment] (3,200 XP: Farren's Report goes to Major Samuelson in Stormwind Keep, chapter 25) - |cffffcc00Gear (562):|r Fish Gutter is a one-handed axe (16.7 dps, +5 Spi): vendor it, neither a two-hander nor a ranged hunter wants it [G51.5,58.4 Hillsbrad Foothills]
At [TAR2705 Brewmeister Bilger], [QT98071] - |cffffcc00Gear:|r Brewer's Bracers are mail (+4 Str +2 Sta): vendor [G52.1,58.7 Hillsbrad Foothills]

[OC]|cffffffffTurtle bisque|r  -  Snapjaws (level 30-31) live along the river east of town: three at x56 y51-57, four more up the bank to 64,40 and nine further north-east. The one grind risk of the chapter, so keep the budget
Kill [TAR2408 Snapjaw] along the river bank east of town for 10 Turtle Meat (the Soothing Spices you bought are the other half) [QC555] [G55.9,54.0 Hillsbrad Foothills]
[O]No meat after ~10 minutes (16 Snapjaws in the whole zone, slow respawn): give it up and abandon the bisque [QS555]
At [TAR2430 Chef Jessen], [QT555] (the reward is the Soothing Turtle Bisque recipe and one bisque) [G51.9,58.7 Hillsbrad Foothills]

