[O]At [TAR2438 Bartolo Ginsetti], [QT565] - |cffffcc00Gear:|r Yeti Fur Cloak (23 armor, +3 Str +6 Agi) is the fixed reward: wear it unless your cloak is better [G49.4,55.5 Hillsbrad Foothills]
