[OC]|cFFFF0000GROUP 3+|r |cffffcc00Preserving Knowledge:|r the biggest XP in town (3,550 now, 3,550 more at Milton Sheaf in chapter 25) and the hardest. |cffffcc00Needs Southshore (538) from chapter 18:|r Dibbs offers it only after you hand 538 in. 5 Recovered Tomes from the Crushridge ogres (Ogres 34-35, Brutes 35-36, plus ELITE Maulers 36-37 and Mages 37-38) and the Worn Leather Book from the Weathered Bookcase in Crushridge Hold, Alterac. No drop rate and no route in the DB, and everything is 4-8 levels above you: bring the tank friend or skip it
