[OC][A Shaman] |cffffffffCall of Water: Silverpine|r  -  94503 (picked up at the Forgotten Shrine in chapter 22) ends at the Minor Manifestation of Water in Silverpine, west of the Hillsbrad Fields (2,935 XP across 94503 and 94505 at quest level, ~1,800 at level 30). Ghost Wolf all the way (outdoors only); budget ~15 minutes each way, unverified. |cffffcc00Caution:|r the Sepulcher (Forsaken town) is 6 units from the manifestation and its guards are level 40 Deathguards: stay away from them and leave as soon as you have the shard (Classic-era: Forsaken guards attack Alliance on sight on PvP realms)
