[A Shaman] At the [TAR5895 Minor Manifestation of Water], [QT94503] [QA94505 Call of Water] (2,750 XP at quest level, ~1,650 at level 30. The Shard of Water is handed to you and the DB lists no objective, so there is nothing to kill; a level 22 Corrupt Minor Manifestation of Water and a level 19 Corrupt Water Spirit stand within a unit of it) [G38.6,44.6 Silverpine Forest]
